OL,3,AMan who killed dog walker should be
OL,4,Adeported, says judge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSafi, who was having paranoid delusions
OL,7,Fand hearing voices, attacked his
OL,8,Flandlord Shahzad Farrukh minutes before
OL,9,Fkilling Broadhurst, and also stabbed a
OL,10,F14-year-old boy. The 28-year-old
OL,11,Fadmitted manslaughter by reason of
OL,12,Fdiminished responsibility.
OL,14,FMrs Justice Cutts, who told the court
OL,15,Fthat Safi had been "in a psychotic
OL,16,Fstate", said the final decision on
OL,17,Fwhether he should be deported rested
OL,18,Fwith the home secretary.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
